{"id":"c918641c9979bdb2","group":"20","path":"20/20-cor-complement-K-not-ce.md","title":"停机集补集不可枚举","display":"cor-complement-K-not-ce — 停机集补集不可枚举","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-cor-complement-K-not-ce","aliases":["20-cor-complement-K-not-ce"],"display":"cor-complement-K-not-ce — 停机集补集不可枚举","chapter":"2","section":"2.1","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Corollary 2.1.15","source_pdf_pages":[63],"source_printed_pages":[27],"depends_on":["[[20-thm-K-undecidable]]","[[20-thm-rec-re]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-cor-complement-K-not-ce"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-cor-complement-K-not-ce</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-complement-K-not-ce — 停机集补集不可枚举"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Corollary 2.1.15"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>63</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d18ba716e49ac8c6\" href=\"?note=d18ba716e49ac8c6\" title=\"20-thm-K-undecidable\">20-thm-K-undecidable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"550ce05cba351a42\" href=\"?note=550ce05cba351a42\" title=\"20-thm-rec-re\">20-thm-rec-re</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\in\\mathcal E\\setminus\\mathcal R\">\\(K\\in\\mathcal E\\setminus\\mathcal R\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d18ba716e49ac8c6\" href=\"?note=d18ba716e49ac8c6\" title=\"20-thm-K-undecidable\">20-thm-K-undecidable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"550ce05cba351a42\" href=\"?note=550ce05cba351a42\" title=\"20-thm-rec-re\">20-thm-rec-re</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}complement\\text{-}K\\text{-}not\\text{-}ce}\\vdash\n\\omega\\setminus K\\notin\\mathcal E.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}complement\\text{-}K\\text{-}not\\text{-}ce}\\vdash\n\\omega\\setminus K\\notin\\mathcal E.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若补集也 c.e.，补集枚举判定定理会令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 可计算。</p>\n<p>来源：Corollary 2.1.15；印刷页 27；PDF 第 63 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-K-undecidable","status":"resolved","id":"d18ba716e49ac8c6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-K-undecidable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-rec-re","status":"resolved","id":"550ce05cba351a42","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-rec-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-K-undecidable","status":"resolved","id":"d18ba716e49ac8c6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-K-undecidable]]；see [[20-thm-rec-re]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-rec-re","status":"resolved","id":"550ce05cba351a42","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-K-undecidable]]；see [[20-thm-rec-re]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K\\in\\mathcal E\\setminus\\mathcal R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}complement\\text{-}K\\text{-}not\\text{-}ce}\\vdash\n\\omega\\setminus K\\notin\\mathcal E.","display":true},{"tex":"K","display":false}],"bytes":960,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["d18ba716e49ac8c6","550ce05cba351a42"]}